sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as WP Admin UI
    participant Plugin as Context Alt Text (WP)
    participant Recognition as Recognition API
    participant LLM as Caption Provider

    Admin->>Plugin: Select images missing alt text
    Plugin->>Recognition: POST /api/v0/analyze-scene (image URL)
    Recognition-->>Plugin: SceneAnalysisResult
    Plugin->>LLM: generateCaption(SceneAnalysisResult, policy)
    LLM-->>Plugin: Caption draft
    Plugin->>Admin: Display draft alt text + entities
    Admin->>Plugin: Approve draft
    Plugin->>Plugin: Persist _wp_attachment_image_alt meta
    Plugin-->>Admin: Confirmation + activity log entry
